        <activityName xml:lang="en">Slipform paver, 65t, 320kW, diesel</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Slipform paver, 65t, 320kW, diesel
Modern European technologies are applied to regional storage facilities, material extraction, and production processes. 
UUID: a581c083-e30d-4315-b70a-a324f2245ce3
This process represents the operation of a slipform paver for one hour in Switzerland and includes diesel combustion and the associated building machine demand as subprocesses. Specific diesel demand, service life time, operation weight and annual operating hours have been taken into account. Waste disposal processes are not included in the scope of this dataset.
Location: Switzerland
Technology: Operation of a slipform paver, -65 t, -320 kW using diesel as fuel.
Time period: Review of data currency scheduled after 5 years.
Production volume: 
Sampling: 
Extrapolations: None
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_a581c083-e30d-4315-b70a-a324f2245ce3.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
